WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.795
I work in a sporting organisation. We run an elite pathway. It's a good one.

00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:06.737
Monday.

00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:12.619
A parent rings. Where does the pathway actually go? What does it look like?

00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:15.557
We've got photos of that. Somewhere.

00:00:17.157 --> 00:00:18.807
We should be able to show them.

00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:22.848
Selection wants something current on the under-seventeens.

00:00:23.248 --> 00:00:26.917
We've got four hundred. Two years old. Mostly action.

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:31.332
Good at showing what happened. Not much that shows who they are now.

00:00:32.557 --> 00:00:36.614
A sponsor wants to see what they'd be part of. They get last year's pitch.

00:00:37.114 --> 00:00:39.791
They ask where's the talent that could carry their brand.

00:00:40.591 --> 00:00:41.347
Fair question.

00:00:42.147 --> 00:00:43.587
We should be able to show them.

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:48.437
There's a funding round coming. We need a new roof on the stand.

00:00:48.937 --> 00:00:51.487
We haven't got one decent photo of the old one.

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:54.062
Should be able to show them that, too.

00:00:55.953 --> 00:00:58.607
Nothing's wrong with the photos. There are thousands.

00:00:59.307 --> 00:01:01.907
We'd never built the library around what we need.

00:01:03.117 --> 00:01:03.757
So we did.

00:01:05.157 --> 00:01:08.316
Kept what did the job. And then we could see the gaps.

00:01:09.516 --> 00:01:10.181
Tuesday.

00:01:11.396 --> 00:01:16.455
A parent rings. Teams. Training. Where the pathway has taken the older ones.

00:01:16.755 --> 00:01:17.905
Now we can show them.

00:01:19.009 --> 00:01:25.526
Selection wants the seventeens. Last Saturday. Action. Portraits. Who's leading it.

00:01:25.826 --> 00:01:26.956
Now we can show them.

00:01:28.165 --> 00:01:33.688
The sponsor wants to see what they'd be part of. Athletes. Team portraits. The crowd.

00:01:34.488 --> 00:01:36.103
They had some ideas of their own.

00:01:37.338 --> 00:01:39.773
One of the seventeens makes the state squad.

00:01:40.173 --> 00:01:45.388
We've already got her portrait. It goes with her. The pathway record stays with us.

00:01:46.388 --> 00:01:47.063
And the roof?

00:01:48.676 --> 00:01:50.080
Camera. Click.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.105
Now we can show them that, too.

00:01:54.655 --> 00:01:57.195
Apparently that's called visual infrastructure.

00:01:58.795 --> 00:02:01.365
The pathway was already creating the value.

00:02:01.525 --> 00:02:03.075
Now we can show it.
